<section image-layout="blank" id="MovnG_AAcg"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item><labels><label variant="solid">REQUEST · POST /login</label><label variant="outline">ILLUSTRATIVE TRACE</label></labels><h2>One request, seven observable hops</h2><p>The cyan trace follows one request. Violet outlines are trust boundaries; mint is the verified response.</p><freeform-block w="840" h="270"><box type="image" x="0" y="0" w="840" h="270" sizing="fixed" src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/t1IP1h54qlFglGnNMS5uP.png" alt="Dark isometric server infrastructure used as a restrained architecture backdrop"></box><box type="content" x="0" y="0" w="840" h="270" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(5,10,19,0.78)"></box><box type="content" x="208" y="6" w="420" h="140" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(155,123,255,0.10)" style="border: 1pt solid #9B7BFF; border-radius: 10pt;"></box><box type="content" x="220" y="10" w="190"><p role="eyebrow">APPLICATION BOUNDARY</p></box><box type="content" x="628" y="6" w="212" h="140" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(155,123,255,0.10)" style="border: 1pt solid #9B7BFF; border-radius: 10pt;"></box><box type="content" x="640" y="10" w="170"><p role="eyebrow">DATA BOUNDARY</p></box><box type="content" x="293" y="157" w="254" h="110" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(155,123,255,0.10)" style="border: 1pt solid #9B7BFF; border-radius: 10pt;"></box><box type="content" x="305" y="160" w="190"><p role="eyebrow">SESSION BOUNDARY</p></box><shape preset="rightArrow" x="198" y="83" w="18" h="18" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="rightArrow" x="408" y="83" w="18" h="18" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="rightArrow" x="618" y="83" w="18" h="18" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="downArrow" x="726" y="141" w="18" h="24" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="leftArrow" x="576" y="211" w="18" h="18" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="leftArrow" x="281" y="211" w="18" h="18" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><box type="content" x="10" y="42" w="188" h="96" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">01 · BROWSER</p><h4>HTTPS form</h4><p font-size="sm">email · password · _csrf</p></box><box type="content" x="220" y="42" w="188" h="96" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">02 · ROUTE</p><h4>Validate</h4><p font-size="sm">Check shape; normalize email.</p></box><box type="content" x="430" y="42" w="188" h="96" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">03 · MIDDLEWARE</p><h4>Rate limit + CSRF</h4><p font-size="sm">Reject abusive or forged requests.</p></box><box type="content" x="640" y="42" w="188" h="96" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">04 · STUDENT STORE</p><h4>Lookup</h4><p font-size="sm">Parameterized query by email.</p></box><box type="content" x="600" y="178" w="230" h="84" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">05 · DECISION</p><h4>bcrypt.compare()</h4><p font-size="sm">Password vs. stored hash.</p></box><box type="content" x="305" y="178" w="230" h="84" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">06 · SESSION STORE</p><h4>Regenerate + save</h4><p font-size="sm">Store student id and role server-side.</p></box><box type="content" x="10" y="178" w="230" h="84" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-3" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">07 · RESPONSE</p><h4>303 + opaque sid</h4><p font-size="sm">Redirect to /dashboard.</p></box></freeform-block><p font-size="sm"><b>Browser invariant:</b> it never receives <code>password_hash</code>, a role-bearing token, or server-side session state.</p></grid-item></grid></section>